SCOPE AND EXCLUSIONS

This license does NOT extend to artifacts that are not distributed in this
repository and whose release is governed separately:

  * The OmniRAS-PR and YT-Chole Triplet datasets. These were constructed under
    two separate IRB-approved protocols. Their release will follow the
    corresponding institutional, privacy, and data-use requirements, and will
    carry their own data-use agreement.

  * Surgical video from any source, including the third-party corpora used
    during pretraining, which remain under their original licenses and terms.

  * Model checkpoints, which will be released under their own terms.

  * Evaluation and training code, which will be released under a separate
    software license.

If you cite this work, please see CITATION.cff.
